A simple example that retrieves a user preference by its ID:

```ts
const userPreference =
  await settingsModuleService.retrieveUserPreference("uspref_123")
```

To specify the fields to retrieve:

```ts
const userPreference =
  await settingsModuleService.retrieveUserPreference("uspref_123", {
    select: ["id", "key", "value"],
  })
```
